{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 14,
  "name": "火天大有",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01961",
              "text": "大有。元亨。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01961",
                "bodyParagraph": 1897
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01962",
              "text": "象曰：火在天上，大有。君子以遏恶扬善，顺天休命。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01962",
                "bodyParagraph": 1898
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01964",
              "text": "大有卦：昌隆通泰。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01964",
                "bodyParagraph": 1900
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01965",
              "text": "《象辞》说：本卦下卦为乾为天，上卦为离为火，火在天上，明烛四方，这是大有的卦象。君子观此卦象，取法于火，洞察善恶，抑恶扬善，从而顺应天命，祈获好运。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01965",
                "bodyParagraph": 1901
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01967",
              "text": "大有卦离上乾下，为乾宫归魂卦。大有卦为柔得尊位，抑恶扬善，丰财利义，象征天命所归，得人心，因此主吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01967",
                "bodyParagraph": 1903
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01969",
              "text": "日丽中天，遍照万物；盛大富有，持盈保泰。 得此卦者，正当好运，事事吉祥，大有收获，但需防物极必反，盛极转衰。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01969",
                "bodyParagraph": 1905
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01971",
              "text": "时运：亨通无比，大放异彩。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01971",
                "bodyParagraph": 1907
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01972",
              "text": "财运：放手去做，财富自来。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01972",
                "bodyParagraph": 1908
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01973",
              "text": "家宅：积善之家，子孙保之。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01973",
                "bodyParagraph": 1909
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01974",
              "text": "身体：虚火上升，小心诊治。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01974",
                "bodyParagraph": 1910
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01976",
              "text": "这个卦是异卦（下乾上离）相叠。上卦为离，为火；下卦为乾，为天。火在天上，普照万物，万民归顺，顺天依时，大有所成。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01976",
                "bodyParagraph": 1912
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01977",
              "text": "大象：太阳在天，遍照大地万物，但五阳争一阴，须知有盈即缺。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01977",
                "bodyParagraph": 1913
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01978",
              "text": "运势：得时得运，昌荣大吉，但防物极必反，盛极而衰。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01978",
                "bodyParagraph": 1914
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01979",
              "text": "事业：事业已经取得一定的成就，最忌得意忘形，胡作非为。务必止恶扬善，坚守中正，交往正直的朋友，戒惧谨慎，兢兢业业，真正做到大而不盈，满而不溢，事业可望迈上新的台阶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01979",
                "bodyParagraph": 1915
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01980",
              "text": "经商：兴隆昌盛，已摆脱困难状态，进入兴旺发达的阶段，如能克制贪财的心理，确守诚信原则，公平待人，克勤克俭，尤其应时刻注意市场动向，适时转轨，可望长久。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01980",
                "bodyParagraph": 1916
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01981",
              "text": "求名：已经小有名气，切勿就此满足，停顿不前，尤其不可陷入世俗圈内，应继续努力，在真正朋友的帮助下，更上一层楼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01981",
                "bodyParagraph": 1917
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01982",
              "text": "婚恋：条件优越，可供选择者多，以慎重为好。对于家庭双方应尽力维护。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01982",
                "bodyParagraph": 1918
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01983",
              "text": "决策：性格坚强，勇于战胜困难，奋斗向上，前进途中困难和厄运很多，唯有认真对待才能不断取得成功，如放松警惕，骄傲自满，将带来惨重失败。朋友很多，交际广泛，对事业很有帮助，但其中也有拆台的小人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01983",
                "bodyParagraph": 1919
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01985",
              "text": "大有这一卦是异卦，由乾卦和离卦组成，上卦为离，为火;下卦为乾，为天。火在天上，普照万物，万民归顺，顺天依时，大有所成。火天大有这一卦，从以下方面的含意而得其名：乾刚健，离光明，以刚健的行为，朝着光明的方向去奋斗，成功就大有希望，就会有所得。乾刚健，为内卦， 说明美在内心;离光明，为外卦，说明体现在外部的手段光明磊落。具备这种表里一致的美德，才是真正的大有。火天大有卦位于同人卦之后，《序卦》中这样解释道：“与人同者，物必归焉，故受之以大有。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01985",
                "bodyParagraph": 1921
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01986",
              "text": "”寻找到志同道合的人，大家齐心协力做事，物产自然丰富起来，所以接下来就是大有了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01986",
                "bodyParagraph": 1922
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01987",
              "text": "《象》曰：火在天上，“大有”;君子以遏恶扬善，顺天休命。这句话的意思是说，大有卦的卦象是乾(天)下离(火)上，为火在天上之表象。火焰高悬于天上，象征太阳照耀万物，世界一片光明，农业大丰收，“大有收获”。“顺天休命”，“顺”就是服从的意思;“休”有顺其自然的意思。有道之士在“大有”的时候所作的事就是只需要顺服“天道”;不必过多地操心自己的命运。君子在这个时候要阻止邪恶，颂扬一切善行，顺应天命，替天行道，以保护万物性命。所以一定要注意遏恶扬善，顺天休命。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01987",
                "bodyParagraph": 1923
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01988",
              "text": "大有卦启示的是顺天依时的道理，属于上上卦。象征大有收获，象征富有，从一开始就顺达，昌隆通泰。在占卦时，大有卦属于上上卦，求官得官、求财得财，其间纵有反复，必如所愿。民间卦象诗对此卦的描述：砍树摸雀作事牢，是非口舌自然消，婚姻合伙来费力，若问走失未脱逃。大有卦的卦象是上卦为离为火，下卦为乾为天，火着到了天上便是大有卦的卦象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01988",
                "bodyParagraph": 1924
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0025"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01989",
              "text": "俗话说“众人拾柴火焰高”，大家围在一个火堆旁构成同人卦，可是众人聚在一起每个人给火堆添一把柴便可以让火焰烧到天上去，可见众人团结起来才会有更大的力量，才会有更大的收获。另外，离为日，乾为天，大有卦的卦象还有明日中天的形象。中午的太阳是最亮的，最热的，所以古代常以日中表示事物的鼎盛时期。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01989",
                "bodyParagraph": 1925
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01992",
              "text": "初九。无交害，匪咎；艰则无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01992",
                "bodyParagraph": 1928
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01993",
              "text": "象曰：大有初九，无交害也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01993",
                "bodyParagraph": 1929
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01995",
              "text": "初九：不要彼此侵害，即没有灾祸，既使处于艰难之中，也没有灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01995",
                "bodyParagraph": 1931
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01996",
              "text": "《象辞》说：大有",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01996",
                "bodyParagraph": 1932
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01998",
              "text": "说，不要彼此侵害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01998",
                "bodyParagraph": 1934
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02000",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，心绪不定，小人欺凌，很是艰辛，长辈或有灾难。做官的须急流勇退，不可贪婪荣华富贵。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02000",
                "bodyParagraph": 1936
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02002",
              "text": "时运：刻苦自勉，等待好运。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02002",
                "bodyParagraph": 1938
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02003",
              "text": "财运：基业初创，慎始无害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02003",
                "bodyParagraph": 1939
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02004",
              "text": "家宅：新富可喜，值得珍惜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02004",
                "bodyParagraph": 1940
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02005",
              "text": "身体：健康无虞，讼事宜解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02005",
                "bodyParagraph": 1941
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02007",
              "text": "初九爻动变得周易第50卦：火风鼎。这个卦是异卦（下巽上离）相叠。燃木煮食，化生为熟，除旧布新的意思。鼎为重宝大器，三足稳重之象。煮食，喻食物充足，不再有困难和困扰。在此基础上宜变革，发展事业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02007",
                "bodyParagraph": 1943
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02013",
              "text": "九二。大车以载，有攸往，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02013",
                "bodyParagraph": 1949
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02014",
              "text": "象曰：大车以载，积中不败也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02014",
                "bodyParagraph": 1950
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02016",
              "text": "九二：用大车装物载人，有明确的目的地，没有灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02016",
                "bodyParagraph": 1952
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02017",
              "text": "《象辞》说：用大车装物载人，物积于车中不会散失。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02017",
                "bodyParagraph": 1953
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02019",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，营谋得利，财利丰厚，但不利于老人的健康。做官的闲职者会受到重用。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02019",
                "bodyParagraph": 1955
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02021",
              "text": "时运：正交好运，一路顺风。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02021",
                "bodyParagraph": 1957
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02022",
              "text": "财运：国内国际，无不获利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02022",
                "bodyParagraph": 1958
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02023",
              "text": "家宅：可以乔迁。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02023",
                "bodyParagraph": 1959
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02024",
              "text": "身体：出外就医，讼事得胜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02024",
                "bodyParagraph": 1960
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02026",
              "text": "九二爻动变得周易第30卦：离为火。这个卦是同卦（下离上离）相叠。离者丽也，附着之意，一阴附丽，上下二阳，该卦象征火，内空外明。离为火、为明，太阳反复升落，运行不息，柔顺为心。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02026",
                "bodyParagraph": 1962
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02033",
              "text": "九三。公用亨于天子，小人弗克。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02033",
                "bodyParagraph": 1969
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02034",
              "text": "象曰：公用亨于天子，小人害也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02034",
                "bodyParagraph": 1970
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02036",
              "text": "九三：天子宴请公侯。小人则不能参与。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02036",
                "bodyParagraph": 1972
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02037",
              "text": "《象辞》说：天子宴请公侯，（小人不能参与）因为小人参与国政，将是国家的祸害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02037",
                "bodyParagraph": 1973
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02039",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，有灾难，举步维艰，勿近小人。做官的会受到重任，读书人会取得很好的成绩。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02039",
                "bodyParagraph": 1975
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02041",
              "text": "时运：显荣之时，取贿必败。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02041",
                "bodyParagraph": 1977
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02042",
              "text": "财运：名利并至，勿近小人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02042",
                "bodyParagraph": 1978
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02043",
              "text": "家宅：喜庆宴会，须防仆婢。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02043",
                "bodyParagraph": 1979
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02044",
              "text": "身体：饮食小心，不可争讼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02044",
                "bodyParagraph": 1980
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02046",
              "text": "九三爻动变得周易第38卦：火泽睽。这个卦是异卦（下兑上离）相叠。离为火；兑为泽。上火下泽，相违不相济。克则生，往复无空。万物有所不同，必有所异，相互矛盾。睽即矛盾。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02046",
                "bodyParagraph": 1982
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02054",
              "text": "九四。匪其彭，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02054",
                "bodyParagraph": 1990
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02055",
              "text": "象曰：匪其彭，无咎，明辩晰也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02055",
                "bodyParagraph": 1991
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02057",
              "text": "九四：用曝晒男巫来求雨，旱情严重，但没有灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02057",
                "bodyParagraph": 1993
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02058",
              "text": "《象辞》说：反对坏人坏事没有灾祸，因为明于考察辨析。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02058",
                "bodyParagraph": 1994
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02060",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，宜守常，则可避免伤害，眼睛方面或会出现病症。做官的须安于现状，不可激进，则可免祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02060",
                "bodyParagraph": 1996
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02062",
              "text": "时运：持盈保泰，知足不辱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02062",
                "bodyParagraph": 1998
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02063",
              "text": "财运：利益已足，勿再贪求。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02063",
                "bodyParagraph": 1999
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02064",
              "text": "家宅：荣美可观，满则招损。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02064",
                "bodyParagraph": 2000
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02065",
              "text": "身体：膨胀之症。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02065",
                "bodyParagraph": 2001
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02067",
              "text": "九四爻动变得周易第26卦：山天大畜。这个卦是异卦（下乾上艮）相叠。乾为天，刚健；艮为山，笃实。畜者积聚，大畜意为大积蓄。为此不畏严重的艰难险阻，努力修身养性以丰富德业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02067",
                "bodyParagraph": 2003
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02073",
              "text": "六五。厥孚交如，威如，吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02073",
                "bodyParagraph": 2009
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02074",
              "text": "象曰：厥孚交如，信以发志也；威如之吉，易而无备也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02074",
                "bodyParagraph": 2010
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02076",
              "text": "六五：来犯之敌被紧紧捆绑，严厉惩罚，吉利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02076",
                "bodyParagraph": 2012
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02077",
              "text": "《象辞》说：其人诚信坦白，因为他以诚信来表现自己的志向。威服众人之所以吉利，因为众人敬畏，则能平安而不困惫。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02077",
                "bodyParagraph": 2013
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02079",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，须相时而动，切不可骄傲自负，以免自取其祸。做官的宜退不宜进。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02079",
                "bodyParagraph": 2015
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02081",
              "text": "时运：众人信服，晚运亨通。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02081",
                "bodyParagraph": 2017
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02082",
              "text": "财运：人和为贵，富有不难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02082",
                "bodyParagraph": 2018
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02083",
              "text": "家宅：一家和睦，须防盗贼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02083",
                "bodyParagraph": 2019
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02084",
              "text": "身体：保持门面。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02084",
                "bodyParagraph": 2020
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02086",
              "text": "六五爻动变得周易第1卦：乾为天。这个卦是同卦（下乾上乾）相叠。象征天，喻龙（德才的君子），又象征纯粹的阳和健，表明兴盛强健。乾卦是根据万物变通的道理，以“元、亨、利、贞”为卦辞，表示吉祥如意，教导人遵守天道的德行。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02086",
                "bodyParagraph": 2022
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02092",
              "text": "上九。自天祐之，吉无不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02092",
                "bodyParagraph": 2028
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02093",
              "text": "象曰：大有上吉，自天祐也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02093",
                "bodyParagraph": 2029
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02095",
              "text": "上九：上天保祐，吉利，无所不顺利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02095",
                "bodyParagraph": 2031
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02096",
              "text": "《象辞》说：大有是大吉大利之卦，因为得到上天的保祐。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02096",
                "bodyParagraph": 2032
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02098",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，得到祖上之庇佑，一路好运。做官的以及读书人会进职成名。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02098",
                "bodyParagraph": 2034
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02100",
              "text": "时运：一路好运，事皆吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02100",
                "bodyParagraph": 2036
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02101",
              "text": "财运：百货畅达，自然获利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02101",
                "bodyParagraph": 2037
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02102",
              "text": "家宅：福庆满门。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02102",
                "bodyParagraph": 2038
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02103",
              "text": "身体：得神庇佑，或即归天。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02103",
                "bodyParagraph": 2039
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02105",
              "text": "上九爻动变得周易第34卦：雷天大壮。这个卦是异卦（下乾上震）相叠。震为雷；乾为天。乾刚震动。天鸣雷，云雷滚，声势宏大，阳气盛壮，万物生长。刚壮有力故曰壮。大而且壮，故名大壮。四阳壮盛，积极而有所作为，上正下正，标正影直。",
              "sourceRef": {
